{
    "meta": {
        "id": "scene12_hidden",
        "title": "Rumah Sakit — Hidden Ending",
        "background": "white",
        "entry": "scene12_hidden_n001"
    },
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "scene12_hidden_n001",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "Gelap. {playerName} membuka mata. Di hadapannya, ada Xyera.",
            "next": "scene12_hidden_n002"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene12_hidden_n002",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "{playerName}",
            "expression": "neutral",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "Xyera",
                    "expression": "neutral",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": false
                }
            ],
            "text": "Kita di mana?",
            "next": "scene12_hidden_n003"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene12_hidden_n003",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "Xyera",
            "expression": "smile",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "Xyera",
                    "expression": "smile",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "(tersenyum) Tempat ini tidak seharusnya kamu datangi secepat ini. Tapi ada seseorang... yang ingin bertemu.",
            "next": "scene12_hidden_n004"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene12_hidden_n004",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "Ia mengulurkan tangan. Mereka berjalan. Sampai di sebuah taman. Di bawah pohon besar...",
            "next": "scene12_hidden_n005"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene12_hidden_n005",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "Samuel dan ibunya berdiri. {playerName} terkejut, matanya berkaca-kaca. Ia berlari dan langsung memeluk mereka. Tangisnya pecah.",
            "next": "scene12_hidden_n006"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene12_hidden_n006",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "{playerName}",
            "expression": "neutral",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "father",
                    "expression": "neutral",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "Aku merindukan kalian.",
            "next": "scene12_hidden_n007"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene12_hidden_n007",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "mother",
            "expression": "neutral",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "mother",
                    "expression": "neutral",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "(mengusap rambutnya) Kami juga.",
            "next": "scene12_hidden_n008"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene12_hidden_n008",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "father",
            "expression": "smile",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "father",
                    "expression": "smile",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "(tersenyum) Kau hebat sekali, anakku.",
            "next": "scene12_hidden_n009"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene12_hidden_n009",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "{playerName}",
            "expression": "smile",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "father",
                    "expression": "smile",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": false
                }
            ],
            "text": "(tersenyum) Iya. (menoleh kepada Xyera) Dia selalu menemaniku di saat aku merasa sendiri.",
            "next": "scene12_hidden_n010"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene12_hidden_n010",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "father",
            "expression": "smile",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "father",
                    "expression": "smile",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "(tersenyum hangat) Setelah malam itu... Kami tidak bisa lagi menjagamu.",
            "next": "scene12_hidden_n011"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene12_hidden_n011",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "mother",
            "expression": "neutral",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "mother",
                    "expression": "neutral",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "Jadi... Hatimu menciptakan seseorang... yang bisa menggantikan kami. Seseorang itu adalah Xyera.",
            "next": "scene12_hidden_n012"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene12_hidden_n012",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "Xyera",
            "expression": "smile",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "Xyera",
                    "expression": "smile",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "Aku bukan ayahmu. Aku bukan ibumu. Aku hanyalah... wujud kasih sayang yang tidak sempat mereka berikan.",
            "next": "scene12_hidden_n013"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene12_hidden_n013",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "{playerName}",
            "expression": "neutral",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "Xyera",
                    "expression": "smile",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": false
                }
            ],
            "text": "(menangis) Terima kasih...",
            "next": "scene12_hidden_n014"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene12_hidden_n014",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "Xyera mengusap kepala {playerName}, seperti yang selalu ia lakukan.",
            "next": "scene12_hidden_n015"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene12_hidden_n015",
            "type": "line",
            "speaker": "Xyera",
            "expression": "neutral",
            "characters": [
                {
                    "characterId": "Xyera",
                    "expression": "neutral",
                    "position": "center",
                    "isSpeaking": true
                }
            ],
            "text": "Sekarang... mereka yang akan menjagamu.",
            "next": "scene12_hidden_n016"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene12_hidden_n016",
            "type": "narration",
            "text": "Perlahan, tubuh Xyera menghilang yang menyatu dengan pelukan kedua orang tua {playerName}. Cahaya putih memenuhi layar.",
            "next": "scene12_hidden_end"
        },
        {
            "id": "scene12_hidden_end",
            "type": "end",
            "endingId": "hidden-ending"
        }
    ]
}
